# Vulcanized Fiber Fiberglass Composite Tube (硬化纤维复合玻纤管)

**Document:** Engineering reference, P14, revision 2026-09  
**Product family:** Fuse & Composite  
**Manufacturer:** WELLELE (Well Electric)  
**Product page:** https://wellele.com/solutions/fuse-components.html

